{"id":"n5-094","title":"だれも～ません (daremo ~masen)","jlptLevel":5,"shortExplanation":"Express 'nobody' or 'no one' in negative sentences.","longExplanation":"The grammar point だれも is used in combination with a negative form of the verb, usually ません, to express the idea of 'nobody' or 'no one' doing something. It is used with questions or statements and can be translated as 'nobody' or 'no one' in English.","formation":"だれも + Verb-negative (ません)","examples":[{"jp":"だれも秘密を知りません。","romaji":"Daremo himitsu wo shirimasen.","en":"No one knows the secret.","words":[{"surface":"だれ","vocabId":"1416830","reading":"だれ"},{"surface":"も","vocabId":null},{"surface":"秘密","vocabId":"1484150","reading":"ひみつ"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"知り","vocabId":"1420470","reading":"しる","baseForm":"知る"},{"surface":"ませ","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"ます"},{"surface":"ん","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[0,1]},{"jp":"だれもその質問に答えませんでした。","romaji":"Daremo sono shitsumon ni kotaemasen deshita.","en":"Nobody answered that question.","words":[{"surface":"だれ","vocabId":"1416830","reading":"だれ"},{"surface":"も","vocabId":null},{"surface":"その","vocabId":null},{"surface":"質問","vocabId":"1320760","reading":"しつもん"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"答え","vocabId":"1449530","reading":"こたえ","baseForm":"答える"},{"surface":"ませ","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"ます"},{"surface":"ん","vocabId":null},{"surface":"でし","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"です"},{"surface":"た","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[0,1]},{"jp":"だれも彼を助けてあげません。","romaji":"Daremo kare wo tasukete agemasen.","en":"Nobody will help him.","words":[{"surface":"だれ","vocabId":"1416830","reading":"だれ"},{"surface":"も","vocabId":null},{"surface":"彼","vocabId":"1483070","reading":"かれ"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"助け","vocabId":"1344390","reading":"たすけ","baseForm":"助ける"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"あげ","vocabId":"1352300","reading":"あげ","baseForm":"あげる"},{"surface":"ませ","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"ます"},{"surface":"ん","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[0,1]},{"jp":"だれもその映画を見たがりません。","romaji":"Daremo sono eiga wo mitagarimasen.","en":"No one wants to watch that movie.","words":[{"surface":"だれ","vocabId":"1416830","reading":"だれ"},{"surface":"も","vocabId":null},{"surface":"その","vocabId":null},{"surface":"映画","vocabId":"1173720","reading":"えいが"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"見","vocabId":"1259290","reading":"みる","baseForm":"見る"},{"surface":"た","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"たい"},{"surface":"がり","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"がる"},{"surface":"ませ","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"ます"},{"surface":"ん","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[0,1]}]}